                "id": "dist-outside",
                "title": "Handle every case in which the target is not contained",
                "body_md": "If $T\\not\\subseteq S$, no subset $U$ of $S$ can contain $T$. Thus every output and summand is zero. This includes both proper-subset and incomparable cases; the original proof omitted the latter.",
