                "id": "dist-equal",
                "title": "Evaluate at the target itself",
                "body_md": "If $S=T$, only the subset $U=T$ contributes the output $c$, with coefficient 1; every proper subset contributes zero. This also covers the empty target, whose only summand is the empty-set output $c$.",
                "justification": ""
