                "body_md": "Put $t=|T|$, $E=N\\setminus T$ and $m=n-t$. SII uses the whole-target finite difference with weight $|S|!(m-|S|)!/(m+1)!$. It does not allocate separately to the members of $T$. The source domain includes both $T=\\varnothing$ and $T=N$.",
