              "signature": "∀ {α : Type u_1} [inst : DecidableEq.{u_1 + 1} α] (z h : α → Real) (i : α) (U : Finset.{u_1} α),\n  i ∉ U →\n    Eq.{u_1 + 1}\n      (Harsanyi.incrementCoordinates.{u_1}\n        (HAdd.hAdd.{u_1, u_1, u_1} z (HSMul.hSMul.{0, u_1, u_1} (h i) (Harsanyi.coordinateDirection.{u_1} i))) h U)\n      (Harsanyi.incrementCoordinates.{u_1} z h (Insert.insert.{u_1, u_1} i U))",
              "lean_excerpt": "theorem incrementCoordinates_insert (z h : α → ℝ) (i : α) (U : Finset α) (hi : i ∉ U) :\n    incrementCoordinates (z + h i • coordinateDirection i) h U =\n      incrementCoordinates z h (insert i U) := by\n  funext j\n  by_cases hj : j = i\n  · subst j\n    simp [incrementCoordinates, coordinateDirection, hi]\n  · simp [incrementCoordinates, coordinateDirection, hj]\n\n/-- The actual masked-coordinate interaction is the rectangular difference.\nNo representation of the model by a polynomial is assumed. -/",
