                "title": "Definitions and original target",
                "body_md": "Let $A^{(k)}=\\sum_{|T|=k}I(T)$ and n=|N|. Under 1-α, for $M\\le m\\le n$ the claim is\n$\\bar g_0^{(m)}=\\binom nm^{-1}\\sum_{|S|=m}g_0(S)=\\sum_{k=1}^M[\\binom mk/\\binom nk]A^{(k)}$.",
                "formula_tex": "\\forall M\\le m\\le n,\\quad\\bar g_0^{(m)}=\\sum_{k=1}^M\\frac{\\binom mk}{\\binom nk}A^{(k)}.",
