                "title": "Reconstruction and grouping by order",
                "body_md": "Use reconstruction on every m-element mask. The empty interaction is zero. Group the remaining terms by order to get $\\sum_{|S|=m}g_0(S)=\\sum_{k=1}^m\\sum_{|S|=m}\\sum_{T\\subseteq S,|T|=k}I(T)$.",
                "formula_tex": "",
