                "id": "iclr2024-sparse-lemma2-step-4",
                "title": "The binomial ratio",
                "body_md": "For $k\\le m\\le n$, both binomial denominators are positive. The identity $\\binom nm\\binom mk=\\binom nk\\binom{n-k}{m-k}$ gives $\\binom{n-k}{m-k}/\\binom nm=\\binom mk/\\binom nk$.",
