        "original_statement_md": "Figures 2–14 and Tables 1–2 report empirical interaction strengths, monotonicity percentages, \\(p\\), valid-interaction counts and computed bounds. The definitions used include \\(\\widetilde I(S)=I(S)/\\max_{S′}|I(S′)|\\), \\(I_{str}^{(m)}=\\mathbb E_{|S|=m}|I(S)|\\), and thresholds \\(0.05\\max_{S′}|I(S′)|\\) (LLMs) or \\(0.1\\max_{S′}|I(S′)|\\) (the tabular MLP). All numerical experimental pages remain directly accessible, but are not original proofs.",
