                "title": "Center the readout identity",
                "body_md": "Flatten the layer/unit indices into a finite set of units. Equation (2) holds for every mask, including the empty mask: $g(T)=\\sum_jw_ju_j(T)$. Subtract the empty-mask equality to obtain the displayed centered weighted sum. Individual unit baselines need not be zero.",
