                "title": "Preserve the printed error and restore its index",
                "body_md": "Fix a target set. The readout theorem gives the weighted sum of unit dividends, and only units with that target field contribute their values. The field indicator must therefore remain. Page 16 instead sums every unit value: two unit fields {1} and {2} with contribution 1 each give target-{1} dividend 1 but printed final sum 2. This is an erroneous intermediate equality; the selected index cannot silently become the full unit index.",
                "justification": "",
