        "statement_tex": "g_Q(T)=g(T\\cup(N\\setminus Q)),\\quad\\varphi_Q(i)=\\sum_j\\mathbf1_{i\\in R_j\\cap Q}\\frac{w_jz_j(x)}{|R_j\\cap Q|}",
