              "signature": "∀ {β : Type u_2} {n : Nat} (J : Finset.{u_2} β) (w c : β → Real) (R : β → Finset.{0} (Fin n))\n  (u : β → Harsanyi.Game.{0} (Fin n)) (Q : Finset.{0} (Fin n)) (i : Fin n),\n  Membership.mem.{0, 0} Q i →\n    (∀ (j : β),\n        Membership.mem.{u_2, u_2} J j →\n          ∀ (T : Finset.{0} (Fin n)),\n            HasSubset.Subset.{0} T Finset.univ.{0} → Eq.{1} (u j T) (ite.{1} (HasSubset.Subset.{0} (R j) T) (c j) 0)) →\n      Eq.{1}\n        (Harsanyi.factorialShapley.{0}\n          (fun T => ∑ j ∈ J, HMul.hMul.{0, 0, 0} (w j) (u j (Union.union.{0} T (SDiff.sdiff.{0} Finset.univ.{0} Q)))) Q\n          i)\n        (∑ j ∈ J,\n          ite.{1} (Membership.mem.{0, 0} (Inter.inter.{0} (R j) Q) i)\n            (HDiv.hDiv.{0, 0, 0} (HMul.hMul.{0, 0, 0} (w j) (c j)) ↑(Finset.card.{0} (Inter.inter.{0} (R j) Q))) 0)",
              "lean_excerpt": "theorem finite_conditional_attribution {n : ℕ} (J : Finset β) (w c : β → ℝ)\n    (R : β → Finset (Fin n)) (u : β → Game (Fin n)) (Q : Finset (Fin n)) (i : Fin n)\n    (hi : i ∈ Q) (hu : ∀ j ∈ J, ∀ T ⊆ (univ : Finset (Fin n)),\n      u j T = if R j ⊆ T then c j else 0) :\n    factorialShapley (fun T => ∑ j ∈ J, w j * u j (T ∪ (univ \\ Q))) Q i =\n      ∑ j ∈ J, if i ∈ R j ∩ Q then w j * c j / (R j ∩ Q).card else 0 :=\n  Network.conditional_forward_shapley J w c R u univ Q i hi\n    (by intro j _; exact subset_univ _) (by intro j hj T; exact hu j hj T (subset_univ T))\n\n/-- The classical factorial definition inherits additive linearity from the proved bridge. -/",
              "evidence_status": "current",
