                "body_md": "Let $h(T)=o(N\\setminus T)$. For nonempty $S$, the definition immediately gives $O(S)=-I_h(S)$. For a singleton, $O(\\{i\\})=o(N)-o(N\\setminus\\{i\\})$; this coefficient activates when the retained set meets $\\{i\\}$.",
