                "formula_tex": "g(N)-b=\\phi(S)+\\sum_{i\\in N\\setminus S}\\varphi(i)+\\sum_{\\varnothing\\ne T\\cap S\\ne S}\\frac{|T\\cap S|}{|T|}J(T).",
                "justification": "",
